OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifters carrying shopping
OL,4,Alists, says M&S manager
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoplifters walk into branches of Marks
OL,7,F& Spencers with a shopping list in an
OL,8,Fattempt to get away with hauls worth
OL,9,Fthousands of pounds, a regional manager
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,FElisa Lewis, who is responsible for M&S
OL,13,Fshops in Shropshire, said shoplifting
OL,14,Fwas a "really large issue" and could be
OL,15,F"a daily, possibly even hourly,
OL,16,Foccurrence".
OL,18,F"In my experience it can be anybody,"
OL,19,Fshe said. "It can be a bored housewife
OL,20,Fwho's just nicking a jacket for a bit
OL,21,Fof fun, and the people who we do catch
OL,22,Fare sometimes those we least expect."
